# Ka of the terminal: the animated panel glows at full brightness while the machine has energy (idle and active models
# set emissive_ambient; the off model does not). The terminal texture is neutral gray, tinted by the theme color.
newmtl terminal
Ka 1.0 1.0 1.0
Kd 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ks 0.0 0.0 0.0
d 1.0
map_Kd #terminal
# Tint layer 0: the player's theme color (TerminalTint); white while off.
neoforge_TintIndex 0
newmtl machine
Ka 0.0 0.0 0.0
Kd 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ks 0.0 0.0 0.0
d 1.0
map_Kd #machine
